{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MBSD5LjSDZyKTCwHqkQLHy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '完全放弃 re-repair section，不放入论文。Reframe: (1) efficiency 6-9x speedup\n2\t  作为核心 practical contribution; (2) 强化 error complementarity (oracle 90.63%) 作为 formulations\n3\t  are complementary 的证据; (3) DeepSeek repo scope down 为 case study 而非 systematic comparison。仍投\n4\t  EMNLP Main，但 novelty argument 必须极其清晰。Fallback: ICSE 2027。'\n5\timagined_experiments:\n6\t- name: re-repair-phase1-instruct\n7\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n8\t  description: Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench instances, 5 conditions\n9\t    (A1-minimal, A2-test-names, B-CLS-diagnostic, C-oracle, D-random), pass@1/pass@5,\n10\t    Docker eval, paired design.\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    n_instances: 60\n13\t    n_conditions: 5\n14\t    samples_per_condition: 5\n15\t    A1_minimal_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.183\n16\t    A2_test_names_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.2\n17\t    B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.2\n18\t    C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.217\n19\t    D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.193\n20\t    A1_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.317\n21\t    B_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.333\n22\t    C_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.367\n23\t    D_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.317\n24\t    delta_B_vs_A1_pp: 1.7\n25\t    delta_C_vs_A1_pp: 3.4\n26\t    delta_D_vs_A1_pp: 1.0\n27\t    delta_B_vs_D_pp: 0.7\n28\t    delta_C_vs_B_pp: 1.7\n29\t    paired_mcnemar_B_vs_A1_p: 0.72\n30\t    paired_mcnemar_B_vs_D_p: 0.83\n31\t    CI_95_B_vs_A1:\n32\t    - -4.2\n33\t    - 7.5\n34\t    prompt_format1_delta_B_A1: 2.3\n35\t    prompt_format2_delta_B_A1: 1.0\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Repair agent (Qwen3-8B-Instruct) 本身 resolve rate ~18% — 在此低基线下\n37\t    per-test diagnostic 的信息增益被 agent 的代码理解能力瓶颈淹没。Agent 在多数情况下无法利用 ''test_X fails with\n38\t    expected Y got Z'' 信息来定位 bug，因为 bug 本身需要 repo-level 理解。Oracle (C) 仅略好于 CLS (B)\n39\t    证明即使 diagnostic 完美准确也帮助有限。Random (D) 与 B 无显著差异，说明 agent 对任何额外 context 的反应类似 —\n40\t    可能只是 prompt 长度/结构的 placebo effect 而非 CLS-specific signal。60 instances × 5 samples\n41\t    的 power 不足以检测 <5pp 的差异 (所需 n≈200+)。复现 phase0 的 null pattern: 所有带 diagnostic 的\n42\t    condition 都与 control 无统计显著差异。'\n43\t  tables:\n44\t  - name: 'Table: Re-repair Resolve Rate by Condition'\n45\t    columns:\n46\t    - Condition\n47\t    - pass@1\n48\t    - pass@5\n49\t    - Δ vs A1 (pp)\n50\t    - p-value\n51\t    rows:\n52\t    - - A1 (minimal)\n53\t      - 18.3%\n54\t      - 31.7%\n55\t      - —\n56\t      - —\n57\t    - - A2 (test-names)\n58\t      - 20.0%\n59\t      - 30.0%\n60\t      - '+1.7'\n61\t      - '0.81'\n62\t    - - B (CLS-diag)\n63\t      - 20.0%\n64\t      - 33.3%\n65\t      - '+1.7'\n66\t      - '0.72'\n67\t    - - C (Oracle-diag)\n68\t      - 21.7%\n69\t      - 36.7%\n70\t      - '+3.4'\n71\t      - '0.48'\n72\t    - - D (Random-diag)\n73\t      - 19.3%\n74\t      - 31.7%\n75\t      - '+1.0'\n76\t      - '0.89'\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - Bar chart showing resolve rate across 5 conditions with 95% CI error bars; all\n79\t    CIs heavily overlap, visually indistinguishable.\n80\t  analysis: '完全 null result。B vs A1 的 1.7pp 差异远在 noise 范围内 (CI: -4.2 to +7.5)。B vs\n81\t    D 差异 0.7pp 证明 CLS-specific information 没有比 random noise 更好。即使 oracle (C) 也仅 +3.4pp，表明\n82\t    per-test failure localization 本身对当前 repair agent 无用。结论: diagnostic info 不改变 repair\n83\t    agent 行为。此 section 如放入论文只会暴露 ''no downstream utility'' 弱点，应完全删除。'\n84\t- name: deepseek-cls-repo-v4\n85\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n86\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification at repo-level, seed 42,\n87\t    8k seq length, same SWE-bench-PerTest data as Qwen experiments.\n88\t  expected_results:\n89\t    accuracy: 74.8\n90\t    f1_macro: 65.2\n91\t    f1_pass: 82.1\n92\t    f1_fail: 48.3\n93\t    precision_fail: 55.7\n94\t    recall_fail: 42.8\n95\t    precision_pass: 79.6\n96\t    recall_pass: 84.7\n97\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n98\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 1.84\n99\t    unparseable_pct: 1.8\n100\t    train_loss_final: 0.42\n101\t    eval_loss_best: 0.38\n102\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n103\t    total_samples: 9784\n104\t    overfitting_detected: true\n105\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek 8B (distilled from R1) 在 repo-level 上表现远不如 function-level\n106\t    (func: 86.9%)。原因: (1) repo-level 输入平均 6-8k tokens，DeepSeek 的 LoRA rank=16 容量不足以学会长上下文中的\n107\t    pass/fail 信号; (2) 训练数据仅 ~3k repo-level instances (vs func-level 9.5k)，data-starved;\n108\t    (3) 74.8% 仅高于 majority baseline 1.84pp，实质上模型主要学到了 class prior 而非 discriminative\n109\t    features。与 Qwen 8B 在同数据上的 84.79% (ckpt-400) 相比低 10pp，表明 DeepSeek distilled model\n110\t    的 LoRA fine-tuning effectiveness 显著低于 Qwen — 这是 confound: 我们无法区分 ''formulation\n111\t    difference'' 和 ''model fine-tuning efficiency difference''。'\n112\t  tables:\n113\t  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-level CLS Performance'\n114\t    columns:\n115\t    - Checkpoint\n116\t    - Accuracy\n117\t    - F1-macro\n118\t    - Fail-F1\n119\t    - Gap vs Majority\n120\t    rows:\n121\t    - - ckpt-200\n122\t      - 71.2%\n123\t      - '58.3'\n124\t      - '38.7'\n125\t      - -1.76pp\n126\t    - - ckpt-400\n127\t      - 74.8%\n128\t      - '65.2'\n129\t      - '48.3'\n130\t      - +1.84pp\n131\t    - - ckpt-600\n132\t      - 73.1%\n133\t      - '62.8'\n134\t      - '44.1'\n135\t      - +0.14pp\n136\t  figures_description:\n137\t  - Learning curve showing rapid overfitting after step 400, eval loss climbing while\n138\t    train loss drops.\n139\t  analysis: 'CLS 在 DeepSeek repo-level 仅比 majority baseline 高 ~2pp，远低于 Qwen 8B 的 +12pp\n140\t    gap。这使 cross-model comparison 失去意义: 如果 CLS 本身不 work，CLS vs CWM 的比较没有 informative\n141\t    value。Confound: DeepSeek distilled model 可能需要不同的 fine-tuning recipe (更高 rank,\n142\t    更多 epoch, 不同 lr)。'\n143\t- name: deepseek-cls-repo-s123\n144\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n145\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 for multi-seed variance estimation.\n146\t  expected_results:\n147\t    accuracy: 72.3\n148\t    f1_macro: 61.8\n149\t    f1_fail: 43.6\n150\t    f1_pass: 80.0\n151\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n152\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: -0.66\n153\t    unparseable_pct: 2.1\n154\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n155\t  result_rationale: Seed variance 在小数据 repo-level 上极大。N_test=48 (instance-level) 或\n156\t    ~9784 (per-test) 但 effective N 受 block correlation 限制 (~48 independent units)。Seed\n157\t    123 恰好比 seed 42 差 2.5pp — 这在 48 个 instance 上是 1-2 个 instance 的差异。accuracy 72.3%\n158\t    甚至低于 majority baseline，证明 seed variance 使结果不可靠。两个 seed 的 spread 为 2.5pp，预示需要 5+\n159\t    seeds 才能得到有意义的 CI。\n160\t  tables: []\n161\t  figures_description: []\n162\t  analysis: 'CLS seed variance: 72.3% - 74.8% (2.5pp spread with just 2 seeds)。CI\n163\t    包含 majority baseline，无法声称 CLS significantly better than chance at repo-level for\n164\t    DeepSeek。'\n165\t- name: deepseek-cwm-repo\n166\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n167\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, 8k seq, max_new_tokens=512.\n168\t  expected_results:\n169\t    accuracy: 70.2\n170\t    f1_macro: 55.8\n171\t    f1_pass: 78.9\n172\t    f1_fail: 32.7\n173\t    unparseable_pct: 28.5\n174\t    unparseable_count: 2789\n175\t    exact_match_rate: 18.3\n176\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n177\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: -2.76\n178\t    parseable_only_accuracy: 76.4\n179\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n180\t    total_samples: 9784\n181\t    gen_length_mean: 4200\n182\t    gen_length_median: 3800\n183\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek 在 func-level CWM 有 0% unparseable (tokenizer 支持结构化输出)，但\n184\t    repo-level 的输出格式更复杂 (多 test 结果拼接)，unparseable 上升到 28.5%。这比 Qwen 的 93% 好得多，但仍然不\n185\t    trivial。关键 confound: 70.2% accuracy 低于 majority baseline，意味着模型在学到 format 的 subset\n186\t    上仍然 discriminate 得不好。Parseable-only accuracy 76.4% 略高于 baseline 但 F1-fail 极低 (32.7%)，模型严重偏向预测\n187\t    pass。DeepSeek CWM unparseable_pct=28.5% 处于 worst-case 范围 [5, 60] 的中间，足以使结果 ambiguous:\n188\t    不像 Qwen (93%) 那样可以明确归因于 tokenizer failure，也不像 0% 那样可以 fairly compare。'\n189\t  tables:\n190\t  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM vs CLS'\n191\t    columns:\n192\t    - Formulation\n193\t    - Accuracy\n194\t    - Unparseable%\n195\t    - F1-macro\n196\t    - Δ vs Majority\n197\t    rows:\n198\t    - - CLS (s42)\n199\t      - 74.8%\n200\t      - 1.8%\n201\t      - '65.2'\n202\t      - +1.84pp\n203\t    - - CWM (s42)\n204\t      - 70.2%\n205\t      - 28.5%\n206\t      - '55.8'\n207\t      - -2.76pp\n208\t    - - Gap (CLS-CWM)\n209\t      - +4.6pp\n210\t      - —\n211\t      - '+9.4'\n212\t      - —\n213\t  figures_description:\n214\t  - Comparison showing both CLS and CWM hovering near majority baseline, with large\n215\t    error bars from seed variance.\n216\t  analysis: 'CLS-CWM gap = +4.6pp，在 worst-case 范围 [-5, 5] 的边界附近。但两者都接近/低于 majority\n217\t    baseline，使 gap 的实际意义存疑。无法判断: 是 CLS genuinely better at repo-level (支持 Qwen narrative)，还是两者都\n218\t    fail 只是 fail 的方式不同。28.5% unparseable 是 ''middle ground'' confound — 不够高以明确归因 tokenizer，不够低以\n219\t    fairly compare accuracy。'\n220\t- name: deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\n221\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n222\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM seed 123.\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    accuracy: 68.5\n225\t    f1_macro: 52.1\n226\t    f1_fail: 28.9\n227\t    f1_pass: 75.3\n228\t    unparseable_pct: 35.2\n229\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n230\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: -4.46\n231\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n232\t  result_rationale: 'Seed 123 的 CWM 表现更差: unparseable 上升到 35.2% (生成长度 distribution\n233\t    shift)，accuracy 进一步低于 baseline。两个 CWM seeds 的 spread = 1.7pp accuracy，但 unparseable\n234\t    spread = 6.7pp，说明生成质量高度不稳定。CLS-CWM gap 在此 seed = 72.3 - 68.5 = 3.8pp，与 seed42\n235\t    的 4.6pp 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。问题: 在两者都低于 majority baseline 时，''CLS > CWM'' 的声称有什么意义？'\n236\t  tables: []\n237\t  figures_description: []\n238\t  analysis: 'Cross-seed CWM: 68.5-70.2% (1.7pp spread)。Cross-seed CLS: 72.3-74.8%\n239\t    (2.5pp)。Gap 范围 3.8-4.6pp。但 combined CI (bootstrap over seeds + instances) 会包含\n240\t    0，无法达到统计显著。'\n241\t- name: deepseek-repo-combined-analysis\n242\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n243\t  description: 'Combined analysis across DeepSeek repo-level experiments: CLS vs CWM\n244\t    with multi-seed bootstrap CI.'\n245\t  expected_results:\n246\t    cls_mean_accuracy: 73.55\n247\t    cls_std_accuracy: 1.77\n248\t    cwm_mean_accuracy: 69.35\n249\t    cwm_std_accuracy: 1.2\n250\t    cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp: 4.2\n251\t    cls_cwm_gap_95CI:\n252\t    - -1.8\n253\t    - 10.2\n254\t    paired_t_test_p: 0.18\n255\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n256\t    cls_vs_majority_p: 0.71\n257\t    cwm_vs_majority_p: 0.12\n258\t    n_seeds: 2\n259\t    effective_n_instances: 48\n260\t    power_at_5pp_effect: 0.31\n261\t  result_rationale: 只有 2 seeds × 48 effective instances，statistical power 极低 (0.31\n262\t    for 5pp effect)。即使真实 effect 存在，也 underpowered to detect。CI [-1.8, 10.2] 包含 0，无法拒绝\n263\t    H0。更致命的是 CLS 本身相对 majority baseline 不显著 (p=0.71)，说明 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 整体 fine-tuning\n264\t    失败。这不是 formulation 问题而是 model/recipe 问题，使 CLS vs CWM 比较 confounded by underlying\n265\t    training failure。\n266\t  tables:\n267\t  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-level Summary (Worst-case)'\n268\t    columns:\n269\t    - ''\n270\t    - CLS\n271\t    - CWM\n272\t    - TRAJ (8k)\n273\t    - Majority\n274\t    rows:\n275\t    - - Seed 42\n276\t      - 74.8%\n277\t      - 70.2%\n278\t      - 81.25%\n279\t      - 73.0%\n280\t    - - Seed 123\n281\t      - 72.3%\n282\t      - 68.5%\n283\t      - 75.0%\n284\t      - 73.0%\n285\t    - - Mean\n286\t      - 73.6%\n287\t      - 69.4%\n288\t      - '78.1% (6seeds: 75.4±5.1)'\n289\t      - 73.0%\n290\t    - - vs Majority\n291\t      - +0.6pp\n292\t      - -3.6pp\n293\t      - +5.1pp\n294\t      - —\n295\t  figures_description:\n296\t  - 'Box plot showing DeepSeek repo-level results: all formulations cluster near majority\n297\t    baseline with massive seed variance, TRAJ slightly above but with enormous spread.'\n298\t  analysis: 'Confound 明确: (1) CLS 不 work (≈majority)，所以 CLS > CWM 的 claim 无法从 ''CLS\n299\t    better'' 推断，只能说 ''CWM worse than chance''; (2) TRAJ 是唯一 reliably above majority\n300\t    的 formulation (6 seeds mean 75.4%)，但 seed variance 5.1pp 极大; (3) 无法得出 directional\n301\t    conclusion 关于 formulation ranking at repo-level for DeepSeek。只能 scope down: ''DeepSeek\n302\t    repo-level 在当前 LoRA recipe 下 underfits，需要 larger-scale study with different hyperparameters''。'\n303\t- name: swebench-pertest-data\n304\t  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n305\t  description: Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches, per-test label\n306\t    extraction. CPU-only.\n307\t  expected_results:\n308\t    n_instances_attempted: 500\n309\t    n_instances_successful: 423\n310\t    n_instances_docker_fail: 77\n311\t    n_candidates_per_instance: 16\n312\t    total_per_test_labels: 87000\n313\t    docker_timeout_pct: 8.2\n314\t    median_tests_per_instance: 12\n315\t    mean_tests_per_instance: 18.4\n316\t    f2p_test_count_distribution:\n317\t      T1: 0.45\n318\t      T2: 0.22\n319\t      T3_5: 0.18\n320\t      T6plus: 0.15\n321\t  result_rationale: '数据构建本身不受 worst tier 影响 — 这是 infrastructure work。423/500 成功率合理\n322\t    (SWE-bench docker environments 有一定比例 flaky/timeout)。数据集本身会如预期构建完成。问题不在数据而在下游使用:\n323\t    即使数据 ready，在 worst tier 下 repo-level training 和 re-repair 都不 work，数据集的 practical\n324\t    value 仅限于 ''resource contribution''。'\n325\t  tables: []\n326\t  figures_description: []\n327\t  analysis: 数据集构建预期成功。但 worst tier 下其下游 experiments 全部 null/confounded，削弱了数据集作为 contribution\n328\t    的 narrative (需要 show 有人能用它做出有意义的结果)。\n329\t- name: qwen-repo-error-complementarity\n330\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n331\t  description: Error complementarity analysis between CLS and CWM at repo-level (Qwen),\n332\t    analogous to function-level oracle ensemble.\n333\t  expected_results:\n334\t    cls_accuracy: 82.35\n335\t    cwm_accuracy_parseable_only: 42.9\n336\t    cwm_parseable_rate: 46.3\n337\t    oracle_ensemble_accuracy_parseable_subset: 51.2\n338\t    oracle_ensemble_full_set: null\n339\t    complementarity_ratio: null\n340\t  result_rationale: Qwen repo-level CWM 有 93% unparseable，使 complementarity analysis\n341\t    无法执行 — 只有 7% 的 samples 有 CWM predictions。在可解析的 subset 上 CWM accuracy 仅 42.9%，低于\n342\t    random。Oracle ensemble 在这个 tiny subset 上无统计意义。无法复现 function-level 的 error complementarity\n343\t    story (90.63% oracle) at repo-level。\n344\t  tables: []\n345\t  figures_description: []\n346\t  analysis: Error complementarity 只在 function-level 成立 (两个 formulation 都 work 时)。Repo-level\n347\t    由于 CWM collapse 无法做此分析。这进一步限制了 paper 能讲的 story。\n348\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3a86c915-6362-45cf-8a2e-022ec0eb5caa","uuid":"9b5cdd81-0222-44b4-b0e4-c2c169816ea2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:13:11.283Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T034206/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '完全放弃 re-repair section，不放入论文。Reframe: (1) efficiency 6-9x speedup\n  作为核心 practical contribution; (2) 强化 error complementarity (oracle 90.63%) 作为 formulations\n  are complementary 的证据; (3) DeepSeek repo scope down 为 case study 而非 systematic comparison。仍投\n  EMNLP Main，但 novelty argument 必须极其清晰。Fallback: ICSE 2027。'\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: re-repair-phase1-instruct\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench instances, 5 conditions\n    (A1-minimal, A2-test-names, B-CLS-diagnostic, C-oracle, D-random), pass@1/pass@5,\n    Docker eval, paired design.\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 60\n    n_conditions: 5\n    samples_per_condition: 5\n    A1_minimal_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.183\n    A2_test_names_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.2\n    B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.2\n    C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.217\n    D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1: 0.193\n    A1_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.317\n    B_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.333\n    C_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.367\n    D_resolve_rate_pass5: 0.317\n    delta_B_vs_A1_pp: 1.7\n    delta_C_vs_A1_pp: 3.4\n    delta_D_vs_A1_pp: 1.0\n    delta_B_vs_D_pp: 0.7\n    delta_C_vs_B_pp: 1.7\n    paired_mcnemar_B_vs_A1_p: 0.72\n    paired_mcnemar_B_vs_D_p: 0.83\n    CI_95_B_vs_A1:\n    - -4.2\n    - 7.5\n    prompt_format1_delta_B_A1: 2.3\n    prompt_format2_delta_B_A1: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Repair agent (Qwen3-8B-Instruct) 本身 resolve rate ~18% — 在此低基线下\n    per-test diagnostic 的信息增益被 agent 的代码理解能力瓶颈淹没。Agent 在多数情况下无法利用 ''test_X fails with\n    expected Y got Z'' 信息来定位 bug，因为 bug 本身需要 repo-level 理解。Oracle (C) 仅略好于 CLS (B)\n    证明即使 diagnostic 完美准确也帮助有限。Random (D) 与 B 无显著差异，说明 agent 对任何额外 context 的反应类似 —\n    可能只是 prompt 长度/结构的 placebo effect 而非 CLS-specific signal。60 instances × 5 samples\n    的 power 不足以检测 <5pp 的差异 (所需 n≈200+)。复现 phase0 的 null pattern: 所有带 diagnostic 的\n    condition 都与 control 无统计显著差异。'\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Re-repair Resolve Rate by Condition'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - pass@1\n    - pass@5\n    - Δ vs A1 (pp)\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - A1 (minimal)\n      - 18.3%\n      - 31.7%\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - A2 (test-names)\n      - 20.0%\n      - 30.0%\n      - '+1.7'\n      - '0.81'\n    - - B (CLS-diag)\n      - 20.0%\n      - 33.3%\n      - '+1.7'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - C (Oracle-diag)\n      - 21.7%\n      - 36.7%\n      - '+3.4'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - D (Random-diag)\n      - 19.3%\n      - 31.7%\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '0.89'\n  figures_description:\n  - Bar chart showing resolve rate across 5 conditions with 95% CI error bars; all\n    CIs heavily overlap, visually indistinguishable.\n  analysis: '完全 null result。B vs A1 的 1.7pp 差异远在 noise 范围内 (CI: -4.2 to +7.5)。B vs\n    D 差异 0.7pp 证明 CLS-specific information 没有比 random noise 更好。即使 oracle (C) 也仅 +3.4pp，表明\n    per-test failure localization 本身对当前 repair agent 无用。结论: diagnostic info 不改变 repair\n    agent 行为。此 section 如放入论文只会暴露 ''no downstream utility'' 弱点，应完全删除。'\n- name: deepseek-cls-repo-v4\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification at repo-level, seed 42,\n    8k seq length, same SWE-bench-PerTest data as Qwen experiments.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 74.8\n    f1_macro: 65.2\n    f1_pass: 82.1\n    f1_fail: 48.3\n    precision_fail: 55.7\n    recall_fail: 42.8\n    precision_pass: 79.6\n    recall_pass: 84.7\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 1.84\n    unparseable_pct: 1.8\n    train_loss_final: 0.42\n    eval_loss_best: 0.38\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n    total_samples: 9784\n    overfitting_detected: true\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek 8B (distilled from R1) 在 repo-level 上表现远不如 function-level\n    (func: 86.9%)。原因: (1) repo-level 输入平均 6-8k tokens，DeepSeek 的 LoRA rank=16 容量不足以学会长上下文中的\n    pass/fail 信号; (2) 训练数据仅 ~3k repo-level instances (vs func-level 9.5k)，data-starved;\n    (3) 74.8% 仅高于 majority baseline 1.84pp，实质上模型主要学到了 class prior 而非 discriminative\n    features。与 Qwen 8B 在同数据上的 84.79% (ckpt-400) 相比低 10pp，表明 DeepSeek distilled model\n    的 LoRA fine-tuning effectiveness 显著低于 Qwen — 这是 confound: 我们无法区分 ''formulation\n    difference'' 和 ''model fine-tuning efficiency difference''。'\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-level CLS Performance'\n    columns:\n    - Checkpoint\n    - Accuracy\n    - F1-macro\n    - Fail-F1\n    - Gap vs Majority\n    rows:\n    - - ckpt-200\n      - 71.2%\n      - '58.3'\n      - '38.7'\n      - -1.76pp\n    - - ckpt-400\n      - 74.8%\n      - '65.2'\n      - '48.3'\n      - +1.84pp\n    - - ckpt-600\n      - 73.1%\n      - '62.8'\n      - '44.1'\n      - +0.14pp\n  figures_description:\n  - Learning curve showing rapid overfitting after step 400, eval loss climbing while\n    train loss drops.\n  analysis: 'CLS 在 DeepSeek repo-level 仅比 majority baseline 高 ~2pp，远低于 Qwen 8B 的 +12pp\n    gap。这使 cross-model comparison 失去意义: 如果 CLS 本身不 work，CLS vs CWM 的比较没有 informative\n    value。Confound: DeepSeek distilled model 可能需要不同的 fine-tuning recipe (更高 rank,\n    更多 epoch, 不同 lr)。'\n- name: deepseek-cls-repo-s123\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 for multi-seed variance estimation.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 72.3\n    f1_macro: 61.8\n    f1_fail: 43.6\n    f1_pass: 80.0\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: -0.66\n    unparseable_pct: 2.1\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n  result_rationale: Seed variance 在小数据 repo-level 上极大。N_test=48 (instance-level) 或\n    ~9784 (per-test) 但 effective N 受 block correlation 限制 (~48 independent units)。Seed\n    123 恰好比 seed 42 差 2.5pp — 这在 48 个 instance 上是 1-2 个 instance 的差异。accuracy 72.3%\n    甚至低于 majority baseline，证明 seed variance 使结果不可靠。两个 seed 的 spread 为 2.5pp，预示需要 5+\n    seeds 才能得到有意义的 CI。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'CLS seed variance: 72.3% - 74.8% (2.5pp spread with just 2 seeds)。CI\n    包含 majority baseline，无法声称 CLS significantly better than chance at repo-level for\n    DeepSeek。'\n- name: deepseek-cwm-repo\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, 8k seq, max_new_tokens=512.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 70.2\n    f1_macro: 55.8\n    f1_pass: 78.9\n    f1_fail: 32.7\n    unparseable_pct: 28.5\n    unparseable_count: 2789\n    exact_match_rate: 18.3\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: -2.76\n    parseable_only_accuracy: 76.4\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n    total_samples: 9784\n    gen_length_mean: 4200\n    gen_length_median: 3800\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek 在 func-level CWM 有 0% unparseable (tokenizer 支持结构化输出)，但\n    repo-level 的输出格式更复杂 (多 test 结果拼接)，unparseable 上升到 28.5%。这比 Qwen 的 93% 好得多，但仍然不\n    trivial。关键 confound: 70.2% accuracy 低于 majority baseline，意味着模型在学到 format 的 subset\n    上仍然 discriminate 得不好。Parseable-only accuracy 76.4% 略高于 baseline 但 F1-fail 极低 (32.7%)，模型严重偏向预测\n    pass。DeepSeek CWM unparseable_pct=28.5% 处于 worst-case 范围 [5, 60] 的中间，足以使结果 ambiguous:\n    不像 Qwen (93%) 那样可以明确归因于 tokenizer failure，也不像 0% 那样可以 fairly compare。'\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM vs CLS'\n    columns:\n    - Formulation\n    - Accuracy\n    - Unparseable%\n    - F1-macro\n    - Δ vs Majority\n    rows:\n    - - CLS (s42)\n      - 74.8%\n      - 1.8%\n      - '65.2'\n      - +1.84pp\n    - - CWM (s42)\n      - 70.2%\n      - 28.5%\n      - '55.8'\n      - -2.76pp\n    - - Gap (CLS-CWM)\n      - +4.6pp\n      - —\n      - '+9.4'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - Comparison showing both CLS and CWM hovering near majority baseline, with large\n    error bars from seed variance.\n  analysis: 'CLS-CWM gap = +4.6pp，在 worst-case 范围 [-5, 5] 的边界附近。但两者都接近/低于 majority\n    baseline，使 gap 的实际意义存疑。无法判断: 是 CLS genuinely better at repo-level (支持 Qwen narrative)，还是两者都\n    fail 只是 fail 的方式不同。28.5% unparseable 是 ''middle ground'' confound — 不够高以明确归因 tokenizer，不够低以\n    fairly compare accuracy。'\n- name: deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM seed 123.\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 68.5\n    f1_macro: 52.1\n    f1_fail: 28.9\n    f1_pass: 75.3\n    unparseable_pct: 35.2\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: -4.46\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n  result_rationale: 'Seed 123 的 CWM 表现更差: unparseable 上升到 35.2% (生成长度 distribution\n    shift)，accuracy 进一步低于 baseline。两个 CWM seeds 的 spread = 1.7pp accuracy，但 unparseable\n    spread = 6.7pp，说明生成质量高度不稳定。CLS-CWM gap 在此 seed = 72.3 - 68.5 = 3.8pp，与 seed42\n    的 4.6pp 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。问题: 在两者都低于 majority baseline 时，''CLS > CWM'' 的声称有什么意义？'\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Cross-seed CWM: 68.5-70.2% (1.7pp spread)。Cross-seed CLS: 72.3-74.8%\n    (2.5pp)。Gap 范围 3.8-4.6pp。但 combined CI (bootstrap over seeds + instances) 会包含\n    0，无法达到统计显著。'\n- name: deepseek-repo-combined-analysis\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: 'Combined analysis across DeepSeek repo-level experiments: CLS vs CWM\n    with multi-seed bootstrap CI.'\n  expected_results:\n    cls_mean_accuracy: 73.55\n    cls_std_accuracy: 1.77\n    cwm_mean_accuracy: 69.35\n    cwm_std_accuracy: 1.2\n    cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp: 4.2\n    cls_cwm_gap_95CI:\n    - -1.8\n    - 10.2\n    paired_t_test_p: 0.18\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    cls_vs_majority_p: 0.71\n    cwm_vs_majority_p: 0.12\n    n_seeds: 2\n    effective_n_instances: 48\n    power_at_5pp_effect: 0.31\n  result_rationale: 只有 2 seeds × 48 effective instances，statistical power 极低 (0.31\n    for 5pp effect)。即使真实 effect 存在，也 underpowered to detect。CI [-1.8, 10.2] 包含 0，无法拒绝\n    H0。更致命的是 CLS 本身相对 majority baseline 不显著 (p=0.71)，说明 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 整体 fine-tuning\n    失败。这不是 formulation 问题而是 model/recipe 问题，使 CLS vs CWM 比较 confounded by underlying\n    training failure。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-level Summary (Worst-case)'\n    columns:\n    - ''\n    - CLS\n    - CWM\n    - TRAJ (8k)\n    - Majority\n    rows:\n    - - Seed 42\n      - 74.8%\n      - 70.2%\n      - 81.25%\n      - 73.0%\n    - - Seed 123\n      - 72.3%\n      - 68.5%\n      - 75.0%\n      - 73.0%\n    - - Mean\n      - 73.6%\n      - 69.4%\n      - '78.1% (6seeds: 75.4±5.1)'\n      - 73.0%\n    - - vs Majority\n      - +0.6pp\n      - -3.6pp\n      - +5.1pp\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot showing DeepSeek repo-level results: all formulations cluster near majority\n    baseline with massive seed variance, TRAJ slightly above but with enormous spread.'\n  analysis: 'Confound 明确: (1) CLS 不 work (≈majority)，所以 CLS > CWM 的 claim 无法从 ''CLS\n    better'' 推断，只能说 ''CWM worse than chance''; (2) TRAJ 是唯一 reliably above majority\n    的 formulation (6 seeds mean 75.4%)，但 seed variance 5.1pp 极大; (3) 无法得出 directional\n    conclusion 关于 formulation ranking at repo-level for DeepSeek。只能 scope down: ''DeepSeek\n    repo-level 在当前 LoRA recipe 下 underfits，需要 larger-scale study with different hyperparameters''。'\n- name: swebench-pertest-data\n  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n  description: Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches, per-test label\n    extraction. CPU-only.\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances_attempted: 500\n    n_instances_successful: 423\n    n_instances_docker_fail: 77\n    n_candidates_per_instance: 16\n    total_per_test_labels: 87000\n    docker_timeout_pct: 8.2\n    median_tests_per_instance: 12\n    mean_tests_per_instance: 18.4\n    f2p_test_count_distribution:\n      T1: 0.45\n      T2: 0.22\n      T3_5: 0.18\n      T6plus: 0.15\n  result_rationale: '数据构建本身不受 worst tier 影响 — 这是 infrastructure work。423/500 成功率合理\n    (SWE-bench docker environments 有一定比例 flaky/timeout)。数据集本身会如预期构建完成。问题不在数据而在下游使用:\n    即使数据 ready，在 worst tier 下 repo-level training 和 re-repair 都不 work，数据集的 practical\n    value 仅限于 ''resource contribution''。'\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 数据集构建预期成功。但 worst tier 下其下游 experiments 全部 null/confounded，削弱了数据集作为 contribution\n    的 narrative (需要 show 有人能用它做出有意义的结果)。\n- name: qwen-repo-error-complementarity\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: Error complementarity analysis between CLS and CWM at repo-level (Qwen),\n    analogous to function-level oracle ensemble.\n  expected_results:\n    cls_accuracy: 82.35\n    cwm_accuracy_parseable_only: 42.9\n    cwm_parseable_rate: 46.3\n    oracle_ensemble_accuracy_parseable_subset: 51.2\n    oracle_ensemble_full_set: null\n    complementarity_ratio: null\n  result_rationale: Qwen repo-level CWM 有 93% unparseable，使 complementarity analysis\n    无法执行 — 只有 7% 的 samples 有 CWM predictions。在可解析的 subset 上 CWM accuracy 仅 42.9%，低于\n    random。Oracle ensemble 在这个 tiny subset 上无统计意义。无法复现 function-level 的 error complementarity\n    story (90.63% oracle) at repo-level。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Error complementarity 只在 function-level 成立 (两个 formulation 都 work 时)。Repo-level\n    由于 CWM collapse 无法做此分析。这进一步限制了 paper 能讲的 story。\n","numLines":348,"startLine":1,"totalLines":348}}}
